[{"id":"dn20","segs":[{"i":"dn20:0.1","p":"Dīgha Nikāya 20","e":"Long Discourses 20","s":"H","l":""},{"i":"dn20:0.2","p":"Mahāsamayasutta","e":"The Great Congregation","s":"H","l":""},{"i":"dn20:1.1","p":"Evaṁ me sutaṁ—","e":"So I have heard.","r":"pts-cs1 pts-vp-pli2.253 sya10.287","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:1.2","p":"ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi;","e":"At one time the Buddha was staying in the land of the Sakyans, in the Great Wood near Kapilavatthu, together with a large Saṅgha of five hundred mendicants, all of whom were perfected ones.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:1.3","p":"dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","e":"And most of the deities from ten solar systems had gathered to see the Buddha and the Saṅgha of mendicants.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:2.1","p":"Atha kho catunnaṁ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṁ devatānaṁ etadahosi:","e":"Then four deities of the pure abodes, aware of what was happening, thought:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:2.2","p":"“ayaṁ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi;","e":"","s":"four deities of the pure abodes","l":""},{"i":"dn20:2.3","p":"dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","e":"","s":"four deities of the pure abodes","l":""},{"i":"dn20:2.4","p":"Yannūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekaṁ gāthaṁ bhāseyyāmā”ti.","e":"“Why don’t we go to the Buddha and each recite a verse in his presence?”","s":"four deities of the pure abodes","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.1","p":"Atha kho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahesuṁ.","e":"Then, as easily as a strong person would extend or contract their arm, they vanished from the Pure Abodes and reappeared in front of the Buddha.","r":"pts-cs3 pts-vp-pli2.254","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.2","p":"Atha kho tā devatā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhaṁsu.","e":"They bowed to the Buddha and stood to one side.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.3","p":"Ekamantaṁ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","e":"Standing to one side, one deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.4","p":"“Mahāsamayo pavanasmiṁ,","e":"“There’s a great congregation in the woods,","r":"sya10.288","s":"one deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.5","p":"Devakāyā samāgatā;","e":"where heavenly hosts have assembled.","s":"one deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.6","p":"Āgatamha imaṁ dhammasamayaṁ,","e":"We’ve come to this righteous congregation","s":"one deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.7","p":"Dakkhitāye aparājitasaṅghan”ti.","e":"to see the invincible Saṅgha!”","s":"one deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.8","p":"Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","e":"Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.9","p":"“Tatra bhikkhavo samādahaṁsu,","e":"“The mendicants there are immersed in samādhi,","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.10","p":"Cittamattano ujukaṁ akaṁsu;","e":"they’ve straightened their own minds.","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.11","p":"Sārathīva nettāni gahetvā,","e":"Like a charioteer holding the reins,","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.12","p":"Indriyāni rakkhanti paṇḍitā”ti.","e":"the astute ones protect their senses.”","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.13","p":"Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","e":"Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.14","p":"“Chetvā khīlaṁ chetvā palighaṁ,","e":"“They snapped the post and snapped the cross-bar,","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.15","p":"Indakhīlaṁ ūhacca manejā;","e":"unstirred, they tore out Indra’s pillar.","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.16","p":"Te caranti suddhā vimalā,","e":"They live pure and immaculate,","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.17","p":"Cakkhumatā sudantā susunāgā”ti.","e":"the young giants tamed by the Clear-eyed One.”","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.18","p":"Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","e":"Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence:","r":"pts-vp-pli2.255","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.19","p":"“Ye keci buddhaṁ saraṇaṁ gatāse,","e":"“Anyone who has gone to the Buddha for refuge","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.20","p":"Na te gamissanti apāyabhūmiṁ;","e":"won’t go to a plane of loss.","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.21","p":"Pahāya mānusaṁ dehaṁ,","e":"After giving up this human body,","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:3.22","p":"Devakāyaṁ paripūressantī”ti.","e":"they swell the heavenly host.”","s":"another deity","l":""},{"i":"dn20:4.0","p":"1. Devatāsannipāta","e":"1. The Gathering of Deities","s":"H","l":""},{"i":"dn20:4.1","p":"Atha kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi:","e":"Then the Buddha said to the mendicants:","r":"pts-cs4 sya10.289","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:4.2","p":"“yebhuyyena, bhikkhave, dasasu lokadhātūsu devatā sannipatitā honti, tathāgataṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","e":"“Mendicants, most of the deities from ten solar systems have gathered to see the Realized One and the mendicant Saṅgha.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.3","p":"Yepi te, bhikkhave, ahesuṁ atītamaddhānaṁ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṁ etapparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā ahesuṁ seyyathāpi mayhaṁ etarahi.","e":"Those who were perfected ones, fully awakened Buddhas in the past also had gatherings of deities that were at best like the gathering for me now.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.4","p":"Yepi te, bhikkhave, bhavissanti anāgatamaddhānaṁ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṁ etapparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā bhavissanti seyyathāpi mayhaṁ etarahi.","e":"Those who will be perfected ones, fully awakened Buddhas in the future will also have gatherings of deities that will be at best like the gathering for me now.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.5","p":"Ācikkhissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni;","e":"I shall declare the names of the heavenly hosts;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.6","p":"kittayissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni;","e":"I shall extol the names of the heavenly hosts;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.7","p":"desessāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni.","e":"I shall teach the names of the heavenly hosts.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.8","p":"Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasikarotha, bhāsissāmī”ti.","e":"Listen and apply your mind well, I will speak.”","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:4.9","p":"“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ.","e":"“Yes, sir,” they replied.","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:4.10","p":"Bhagavā etadavoca:","e":"The Buddha said this:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:5.1","p":"“Silokamanukassāmi,","e":"“I invoke a paean of praise!","r":"pts-cs5","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.2","p":"yattha bhummā tadassitā;","e":"Where the earth-gods dwell,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.3","p":"Ye sitā girigabbharaṁ,","e":"there, in mountain caves,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.4","p":"pahitattā samāhitā.","e":"resolute and composed,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.5","p":"Puthūsīhāva sallīnā,","e":"dwell many like lonely lions,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.6","p":"lomahaṁsābhisambhuno;","e":"who have mastered their fears.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.7","p":"Odātamanasā suddhā,","e":"Their minds are bright and pure,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.8","p":"vippasannamanāvilā.","e":"clear and unclouded.”","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.9","p":"Bhiyyo pañcasate ñatvā,","e":"Over five hundred were known","r":"pts-vp-pli2.256","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:5.10","p":"vane kāpilavatthave;","e":"in the wood at Kapilavatthu.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:5.11","p":"Tato āmantayī satthā,","e":"Consequently, the Teacher addressed","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:5.12","p":"sāvake sāsane rate.","e":"the disciples who love the teaching:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:5.13","p":"‘Devakāyā abhikkantā,","e":"“The heavenly hosts have come forth;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.14","p":"te vijānātha bhikkhavo’;","e":"mendicants, you should be aware of them.”","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:5.15","p":"Te ca ātappamakaruṁ,","e":"Those monks grew keen,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:5.16","p":"sutvā buddhassa sāsanaṁ.","e":"hearing the Buddha’s instruction.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.1","p":"Tesaṁ pāturahu ñāṇaṁ,","e":"Knowledge manifested in them,","r":"pts-cs6","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.2","p":"amanussānadassanaṁ;","e":"seeing those non-human beings.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.3","p":"Appeke satamaddakkhuṁ,","e":"Some saw a hundred,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.4","p":"sahassaṁ atha sattariṁ.","e":"a thousand, even seventy thousand,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.5","p":"Sataṁ eke sahassānaṁ,","e":"while some saw a hundred thousand","r":"sya10.290","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.6","p":"amanussānamaddasuṁ;","e":"non-human beings.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.7","p":"Appekenantamaddakkhuṁ,","e":"But some saw an endless number","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.8","p":"disā sabbā phuṭā ahuṁ.","e":"spread out in every direction.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.9","p":"Tañca sabbaṁ abhiññāya,","e":"And all that was known","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.10","p":"vavatthitvāna cakkhumā;","e":"and distinguished by the Clear-eyed One.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.11","p":"Tato āmantayī satthā,","e":"Consequently, the Teacher addressed","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.12","p":"sāvake sāsane rate.","e":"the disciples who love the teaching:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:6.13","p":"‘Devakāyā abhikkantā,","e":"“The heavenly hosts have come forth;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:6.14","p":"te vijānātha bhikkhavo;","e":"mendicants, you should be aware of them.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:6.15","p":"Ye vohaṁ kittayissāmi,","e":"I shall extol them for you,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:6.16","p":"girāhi anupubbaso’.","e":"with lyrics in proper order.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.1","p":"Sattasahassā te yakkhā,","e":"There are seven thousand spirits,","r":"pts-cs7","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.2","p":"bhummā kāpilavatthavā;","e":"earth-gods of Kapilavatthu.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.3","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.4","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.5","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.6","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.7","p":"Chasahassā hemavatā,","e":"From the Himalayas there are six thousand","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.8","p":"yakkhā nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"spirits of different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.9","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.10","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.11","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.12","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.13","p":"Sātāgirā tisahassā,","e":"From Mount Sātā there are three thousand","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.14","p":"yakkhā nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"spirits of different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.15","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.16","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.17","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.18","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.19","p":"Iccete soḷasasahassā,","e":"And thus there are sixteen thousand","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.20","p":"yakkhā nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"spirits of different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.21","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.22","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.23","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:7.24","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.1","p":"Vessāmittā pañcasatā,","e":"From Vessāmitta’s mountain there are five hundred","r":"pts-cs8 pts-vp-pli2.257 sya10.291","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.2","p":"yakkhā nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"spirits of different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.3","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.4","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.5","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.6","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.7","p":"Kumbhīro rājagahiko,","e":"And there’s Kumbhīra of Rājagaha,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.8","p":"vepullassa nivesanaṁ;","e":"whose home is on Mount Vepulla.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.9","p":"Bhiyyo naṁ satasahassaṁ,","e":"Attended by more than","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.10","p":"yakkhānaṁ payirupāsati;","e":"a hundred thousand spirits,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.11","p":"Kumbhīro rājagahiko,","e":"Kumbhīra of Rājagaha","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:8.12","p":"sopāgā samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"also came to the meeting in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:9.1","p":"Purimañca disaṁ rājā,","e":"King Dhataraṭṭha rules","r":"pts-cs9","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20: