i":"dn20:16.5","p":"Athāguṁ harayo devā,","e":"Then came the gods of Mercury,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.6","p":"ye ca lohitavāsino;","e":"and those who live on Mars.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.7","p":"Pāragā mahāpāragā,","e":"The Pāragas and Mahāpāragas came,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.8","p":"āguṁ devā yasassino;","e":"such glorious gods.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.9","p":"Dasete dasadhā kāyā,","e":"These ten hosts of gods","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.10","p":"sabbe nānattavaṇṇino.","e":"shone in all different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.11","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.12","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.13","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:16.14","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.1","p":"Sukkā karambhā aruṇā,","e":"The gods of Venus, the newborn Sun, <j>and the Dawn","r":"pts-cs17","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.2","p":"āguṁ veghanasā saha;","e":"came along with those from Saturn.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.3","p":"Odātagayhā pāmokkhā,","e":"And the gods of the white globe came","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.4","p":"āguṁ devā vicakkhaṇā.","e":"leading the brilliant gods.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.5","p":"Sadāmattā hāragajā,","e":"The Sadāmattas and Hāragajas,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.6","p":"missakā ca yasassino;","e":"and assorted glorious ones;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.7","p":"Thanayaṁ āga pajjunno,","e":"Pajjuna came thundering,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.8","p":"yo disā abhivassati.","e":"he who rains on all quarters.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.9","p":"Dasete dasadhā kāyā,","e":"These ten hosts of gods","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.10","p":"sabbe nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"shone in all different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.11","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.12","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.13","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:17.14","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.1","p":"Khemiyā tusitā yāmā,","e":"The Khemiyas from the realms of Tusita and Yama,","r":"pts-cs18 pts-vp-pli2.261","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.2","p":"kaṭṭhakā ca yasassino;","e":"and the glorious Kaṭṭhakas came;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.3","p":"Lambītakā lāmaseṭṭhā,","e":"the Lambītakas, Lāmaseṭṭhas,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.4","p":"jotināmā ca āsavā;","e":"those called the Shining, and those Yonder.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.5","p":"Nimmānaratino āguṁ,","e":"The gods who love to create came too,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.6","p":"athāguṁ paranimmitā.","e":"and those who control what is created by others.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.7","p":"Dasete dasadhā kāyā,","e":"These ten hosts of gods","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.8","p":"sabbe nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"shone in all different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.9","p":"Iddhimanto jutimanto,","e":"They’re powerful and brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.10","p":"vaṇṇavanto yasassino;","e":"so beautiful and glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.11","p":"Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ,","e":"Rejoicing, they’ve come forth","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:18.12","p":"bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"to the meeting of mendicants in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.1","p":"Saṭṭhete devanikāyā,","e":"These sixty hosts of gods","r":"pts-cs19 sya10.296","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.2","p":"sabbe nānattavaṇṇino;","e":"shone in all different colors.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.3","p":"Nāmanvayena āgacchuṁ,","e":"They came organized by name,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.4","p":"ye caññe sadisā saha.","e":"these and others likewise, thinking:","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.5","p":"‘Pavuṭṭhajātimakhilaṁ,","e":"‘They who have shed rebirth, the kindly ones,","q":1,"s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.6","p":"oghatiṇṇamanāsavaṁ;","e":"the undefiled ones who have crossed the flood—","q":1,"s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.7","p":"Dakkhemoghataraṁ nāgaṁ,","e":"let us see them, <j>with the dragon who brought them across,","q":1,"s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:19.8","p":"candaṁva asitātigaṁ’.","e":"who like the Moon has overcome darkness.’","q":1,"s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.1","p":"Subrahmā paramatto ca,","e":"Subrahmā and Paramatta came,","r":"pts-cs20","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.2","p":"puttā iddhimato saha;","e":"with sons of those powerful ones.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.3","p":"Sanaṅkumāro tisso ca,","e":"Sanaṅkumāra and Tissa","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.4","p":"sopāga samitiṁ vanaṁ.","e":"also came to the meeting in the wood.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.5","p":"Sahassaṁ brahmalokānaṁ,","e":"Of a thousand realms of divinity,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.6","p":"mahābrahmābhitiṭṭhati;","e":"the Great Divinity stands forth.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.7","p":"Upapanno jutimanto,","e":"He has arisen, brilliant,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.8","p":"bhismākāyo yasassiso.","e":"his formidable body so glorious.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.9","p":"Dasettha issarā āguṁ,","e":"Ten Gods Almighty came there,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.10","p":"paccekavasavattino;","e":"each one of them wielding power,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.11","p":"Tesañca majjhato āga,","e":"and in the middle of them came","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:20.12","p":"hārito parivārito.","e":"Hārita with his following.”","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:21.1","p":"Te ca sabbe abhikkante,","e":"When they had all come forth—","r":"pts-cs21","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.2","p":"sainde deve sabrahmake;","e":"the gods with their Lord, and the divinities—","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.3","p":"Mārasenā abhikkāmi,","e":"Māra’s army came forth too:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.4","p":"passa kaṇhassa mandiyaṁ.","e":"see the stupidity of the Dark Lord!","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.5","p":"‘Etha gaṇhatha bandhatha,","e":"“Come, seize them and bind them,” he said,","r":"pts-vp-pli2.262","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.6","p":"rāgena baddhamatthu vo;","e":"“let them be bound by desire!","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.7","p":"Samantā parivāretha,","e":"Surround them on all sides,","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.8","p":"mā vo muñcittha koci naṁ’.","e":"don’t let any escape!”","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.9","p":"Iti tattha mahāseno,","e":"And so there the great general,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.10","p":"kaṇho senaṁ apesayi;","e":"the Dark Lord sent forth his army.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.11","p":"Pāṇinā talamāhacca,","e":"He struck the ground with his fist","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.12","p":"saraṁ katvāna bheravaṁ.","e":"to make a horrifying sound","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.13","p":"Yathā pāvussako megho,","e":"like a monsoon cloud,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.14","p":"thanayanto savijjuko;","e":"thundering and flashing.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.15","p":"Tadā so paccudāvatti,","e":"But then turned back,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:21.16","p":"saṅkuddho asayaṁvase.","e":"furious, out of control.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.1","p":"Tañca sabbaṁ abhiññāya,","e":"And all that was known","r":"pts-cs22 sya10.297","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.2","p":"vavatthitvāna cakkhumā;","e":"and distinguished by the Clear-eyed One.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.3","p":"Tato āmantayī satthā,","e":"Consequently, the Teacher addressed","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.4","p":"sāvake sāsane rate.","e":"the disciples who love the teaching:","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.5","p":"‘Mārasenā abhikkantā,","e":"“Māra’s army has arrived;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:22.6","p":"te vijānātha bhikkhavo’;","e":"mendicants, you should be aware of them.”","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"dn20:22.7","p":"Te ca ātappamakaruṁ,","e":"Those monks grew keen,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.8","p":"sutvā buddhassa sāsanaṁ;","e":"hearing the Buddha’s instruction.","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.9","p":"Vītarāgehi pakkāmuṁ,","e":"The army fled from those free of passion,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.10","p":"nesaṁ lomāpi iñjayuṁ.","e":"and not a single hair was stirred!","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.11","p":"‘Sabbe vijitasaṅgāmā,","e":"“All triumphant in battle,","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.12","p":"bhayātītā yasassino;","e":"so fearless and glorious.","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.13","p":"Modanti saha bhūtehi,","e":"They rejoice with all the spirits,","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.14","p":"sāvakā te janesutā’”ti.","e":"the disciples renowned among men.”","s":"listeners","l":""},{"i":"dn20:22.15","p":"Mahāsamayasuttaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ sattamaṁ.","e":"","s":"N","l":""}]}]